Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.63,0:03:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a lot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.09,0:03:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Daru and I've been working all night
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.67,0:03:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and haven't been home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.51,0:03:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And everything Daru wears,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,from his T-shirts to his underwear, is XXXL.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I spy Okabe Rintaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.27,0:03:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I should warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,One, my name is Hououin Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, that greeting is dangero—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup, Suzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.66,0:03:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.37,0:03:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, when did you two meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.45,0:03:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We live in the same building.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, we'd at least know each other's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu gave me this Rai-Net card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.62,0:03:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.21,0:03:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To go do the laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin and Daru have been up all night for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:03:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Part-timer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.26,0:04:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't do your job, I'll fire you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.14,0:04:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.27,0:04:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands off my part-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're the one in love, Mr. Braun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Say that when Nae's around. I dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.61,0:04:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll seriously kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nae?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The little woodland creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.07,0:04:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call my daughter a woodland creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.03,0:04:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I be in love with a little kid like her, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an adult and a warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I like that look, Part-Time Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Always remember that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,someday, you'll be able to change classes to a true warrior—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,When you talk, it—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.97,0:04:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already a warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I get all the weirdos?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.27,0:04:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.07,0:05:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a habit of Mayuri's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've taken to calling it the "Stardust Handshake."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if I could reach the stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even see the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, even in the daytime, the stars are still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.60,0:05:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Those were powerful EM waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A cellular malfunction's a real possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But I saw that banana.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.27,0:05:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The PhoneWave (name subject to change) is a time machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd this happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm closing the lid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:06:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru is like the universe—constantly expanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.80,0:06:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining Finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Titor doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me to message him.
