Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:10.89,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(204,1000.5)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.89,0:06:10.93,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(225,967.5)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:10.98,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(246,937.5)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.98,0:06:11.02,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(264,907.5)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:11.06,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(282,882)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:11.10,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(294,862.5)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:11.14,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(304.5,847.5)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.14,0:06:11.18,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(312,837)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:11.23,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(316.5,831)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.23,0:06:13.64,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr-17\pos(318,829.5)\be8\c&HEFEFEF&}Tell me how to reach the Super Haker! \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"Tell me how to reach—"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:16.27,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\pos(750,247.5)\blur1.5\c&H4F4F4F&\frz13.55}You have a new message
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:17.40,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr12.9\fs82.5\blur4.5\pos(581.833,436.666)}John Titor \N\N\N\N\N\N\NAre you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.99,0:06:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Regarding the image you sent of that program,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,it is indeed a proprietary programming language developed by IBN,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.12,0:06:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and decoding it will require an IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The Future Gadget Laboratory
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,will now initiate an emergency secret plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.97,0:06:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Daru!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're about to engage in battle with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,an immense organization that controls the world from the shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.73,0:07:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's SERN!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.78,0:07:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a worldwide organization
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.61,0:07:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,obsessed with dark science, and they're plotting a huge conspiracy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.99,0:07:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The world only needs one mad scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.29,0:07:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We must complete our quest before they do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we need an IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll decode SERN's mysterious program.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mayushii has her part-time job today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So I get to do it alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:42.90,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\c&H717171&\fs50\frz24.12\pos(318.501,549.834)}Name            :  {\c&HF1F1F1&}Shining Finger
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:42.90,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr24\blur3\fs50\c&HAAB0B2&\pos(324.832,702)}Subject     :  {\c&HF1F1F1&}Sorry if I'm bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:42.90,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\fr24\blur3\c&HF1F1F1&\pos(390.666,845.501)}Are you mad? Sorry if I'm bothering you. \N\N\N\NI really need the IBN 5100 information, \N\N\Nand right now, you're the only one I can ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be worth exchanging information.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.57,0:07:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.08,0:07:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You destroyed the jacket's shoulder...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:01.42,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\i1\be5\fr-6\fs49.5\c&HE4E4E4&\pos(525.167,547.833)\fax0.15}Let's both do our best \NI don't have any real information.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:01.42,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\i1\be5\fr-5\fs49.5\c&HE4E4E4&\pos(469.5,723.832)\fax0.15}How about you{\c&H0F1EC8&}?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:01.42,Cellphone,,0,0,0,,{\i1\be5\fr-6\fs49.5\c&HE4E4E4&\pos(1092.169,742.833)\fax0.15}Moeka
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"I don't have any real information."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you glaring at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.30,0:08:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather you didn't blame me for your problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.85,0:08:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sulking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.27,0:08:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri was worried that you might've gotten upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too old to act like a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the last person I want to hear that from.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.74,0:08:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what did you want to talk to me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.11,0:08:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop sulking, come back to the lab, and work, Christina.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.91,0:08:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to at least stick to calling me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to people when they're talking, "The Zombie"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of us isn't listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.37,0:08:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd I get involved with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to punch myself for giving in to my curiosity back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those messages that annoying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you wouldn't believe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she also an Organization agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:08:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the Organization?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.27,0:08:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization is the Organization!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.85,0:09:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an international secret organization,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.48,0:09:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,controlling the world from the shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just a conspiracy theory, thank you very—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.03,0:09:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Any more questions, and I'll hit you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaming others for your problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,After we recover the laundry, I'll give you your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think I'd follow you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.55,0:09:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Laundry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.93,0:09:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't one at the hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's a pretty nice hotel....
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's not my style to send everything I wear to the cleaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.73,0:09:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You found it, thanks to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be gratef—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.69,0:09:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No change?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.90,0:09:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.94,0:09:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think something'll happen when it spins, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.53,0:09:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer lies in the components we find most natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:09:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would expect that hooking a cell phone to a microwave
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,would make a time machine—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a time machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That was some kind of mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Time machines only exist in science fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have no part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.68,0:10:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you try so hard to deny what you saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.97,0:10:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be some kind of past trauma?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.89,0:10:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it happened when she was five.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Christina was struck by lightning on the grassy plains of Arkansas...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's theoretically impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Theories are nothing more than words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Accept what you've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.20,0:10:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.04,0:10:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you being so stub{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.87,0:10:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to make the same mistake my father made!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.96,0:10:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.26,0:10:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I got emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.77,0:11:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I deliberately provoked you to see what you'd do—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the PhoneWave isn't a time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.53,0:11:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.11,0:11:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I forced you to join the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to come anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll tell you this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.75,0:11:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else will ever have the title of Lab Mem 004.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That number will be yours forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a great parting speech!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's what bugs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.13,0:11:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have your laundry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.14,0:11:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.64,0:11:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You should reflect on your thoughtless actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.73,0:11:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.65,0:11:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't grab me there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know anything about the IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:11:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,IBN?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an old PC.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to use it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.50,0:12:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The IBN 5100 is connected to SERN's secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN is researching time travel,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and to decode their secret program,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,we need the IBN 5100's special functionality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.23,0:12:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I listened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You... You snorted!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.95,0:12:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you. Just you wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So just you wait! Christina!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no "-tina"...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN is researching time travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We need the IBN 5100's special functionality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez... I told her because she said she wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A PC?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.30,0:12:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. An old PC...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, it costs 5,100 yen or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,5,100... Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.36,0:13:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! Mayushii heard something amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:17.53,KeitaiKinshiOrSmth,,0,0,0,,{\be30\t(\be0)}{\pos(432,226.5)\bord0}No Cell Phones
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No cell phones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:18.19,KeitaiKinshiOrSmth,,0,0,0,,{\pos(432,226.5)\bord0}No Cell Phones
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris said she's seen the PC you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.19,0:13:18.82,KeitaiKinshiOrSmth,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\move(432,226.5,813.333,23.667,0,630)}No Cell Phones
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No cell phones!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.33,0:13:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris NyanNyan! Faris NyanNyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris NyanNyan! Faris NyanNyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris NyanNyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's yours truly! Nyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.81,0:13:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're starting the Faris Cup daytime group!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, do your best to beat Faris
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:14:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and win a special NyanNyan Omelet Rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.36,0:14:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris NyanNyan! Faris NyanNyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.87,0:14:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.04,0:14:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.63,0:14:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here? Some kind of space-time distortion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's the Faris Cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris is going to play Rai-Net Access Battlers with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.97,0:14:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to participate too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.39,0:14:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris can play up to ten at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.23,0:14:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's still...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.23,0:14:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, the IBN 5100!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.11,0:14:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you if you play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the planet's power structure depends on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Some stupid game—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't play, then I'm sorry, but you'll have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a maid, and you're having your master leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The IBN 5100...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm not listening!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.17,0:15:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'll have to go all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, can you win?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris is one of the country's best players.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I win?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.39,0:15:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be asking Faris that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan that's never failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Plan Code:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.32,0:15:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,G-B-A-C-K.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.45,0:15:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I call it G-Back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds pretty amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.46,0:15:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You say that now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but when this plan explodes, you might not survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.05,0:15:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're serious, aren't you, Kyouma?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make this clear:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,If I participate, you'll tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.81,0:15:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The cat ears never lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:15:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.90,0:16:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1000)}...that there are some opponents you just can't beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.65,0:16:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii's disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What was your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But his constant charging and self-destructing basically screamed, "Get back."{Original: But he just kept charging me, like he was self-destructing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,G-back?{Original: Jibaku?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.75,0:16:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Back... Get Back?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a horrible joke, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.96,0:16:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}However!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you know, Faris.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He recovers quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.71,0:16:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're arrogant for a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I said if I participated, you'd tell me what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, I never cared about winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.39,0:16:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.31,0:16:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.52,0:16:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my brilliant plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.90,0:16:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant or cheating, one of the two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.81,0:16:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.15,0:16:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.19,0:16:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.57,0:16:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure when I was little, Dad had one, but it's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the secret move
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:17:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you mastered in the Guiana Highlands, the Question-Dodge?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.50,0:17:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.75,0:17:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw through my Cold Shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.84,0:17:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure the last time I saw it was at an Akihabara shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.27,0:17:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"Kurisu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you for messaging us all the way from Japan."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.90,0:17:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,"I asked the professor about your question,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.78,0:17:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and he said that, yes, the IBN 5100
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.15,0:17:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,can analyze certain special programming languages."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He was serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A computer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to ask my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.55,0:17:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,An IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't know what that is, tell him it's an old computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.88,0:17:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.97,0:17:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.93,0:17:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,End with the code words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.72,0:17:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,E-El... Psy Kongri...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.73,0:18:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kongroo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Makise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't remember a Makise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd we meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Paris? London?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Akihabara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I just saw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.33,0:18:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What? It's my assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.12,0:18:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say "Christina"!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.00,0:18:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no "-tina"!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.08,0:18:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as loud and bossy as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose fault is that? Whose?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.71,0:18:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.50,0:18:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading to Yanabayashi Shrine...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.35,0:18:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Harassment?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that harassment?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that call about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.43,0:18:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I just asked where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No one called you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.77,0:18:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No one called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.48,0:18:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.19,0:18:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you ask him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he said that we have that PC here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.41,0:19:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,PC?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean an IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.42,0:19:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the IBN—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.42,0:19:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.55,0:19:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of introduction was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.26,0:19:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not your assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.18,0:19:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't even take ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.43,0:19:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a pain, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu, my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.77,0:19:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'm your assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.56,0:19:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Urushibara Luka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.28,0:19:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventeen this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,One year younger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.99,0:19:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a grownup, Makise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Not nearly as pretty as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... I'll call my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better not to know some things, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.80,0:19:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought it would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.01,0:20:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.14,0:20:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well, the person who donated this told us...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,that someday, a young man who needed it would appear,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,so take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.77,0:20:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It was ten years ago, I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.86,0:20:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.20,0:20:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The choice of Steins Gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.83,0:20:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,IBN 5100 Portable Computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, could we borrow it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.01,0:20:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're carrying this back! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.31,0:20:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my assistant, Christina!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your assistant, and there's no "-tina"!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get a cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.94,0:20:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We couldn't ask you for that, after you lent this to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.73,0:20:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.94,0:20:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some respect for others!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.86,0:21:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.74,0:21:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You really just said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are good friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.79,0:21:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Be nice to Luka too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a nice father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.17,0:21:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to make the same mistake my father made!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.85,0:21:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.77,0:21:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The cart's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.23,0:21:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to do this with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.11,0:21:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and carry it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.24,0:21:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a long way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.45,0:21:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.24,0:21:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with your provocations?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you carry it like that, I'll have to walk backward!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Start walking, assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:21:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.55,0:22:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do this walking backward!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.55,0:22:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do it, assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.05,0:22:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the words of support, but no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.72,0:22:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest we walk sideways!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.64,0:22:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, we need to!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.01,0:22:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to trip!
